   $q$Which meaning of "meticulous" is best supported by the examples in paragraph 3?$q$, $q$[{"text":"impatient with slow beginners","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"extremely careful about every detail","is_correct":true},{"text":"eager to finish work quickly","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"skilled at taking photographs","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$extremely careful about every detail$q$, $q$Dr. Lindqvist photographs the map "from six angles," measures tears "to the millimeter," and records "every stain," all signs of great care with details. Photography is only one of those examples, so "skilled at taking photographs" is too narrow.$q$, 'draft', '20b7ea01-ca15-5251-9b32-403268cf47d7')
