  ('4635d34f-62ed-51ed-8cd0-09ccfe52f12e', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-context-clues'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Based on the examples in paragraph 2, "resilient" most nearly means:$q$, $q$[{"text":"easily harmed by changes in weather","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"made of two separate living things","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-context-clue"},{"text":"found mostly in cold mountain areas","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"able to survive hardship and recover","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$able to survive hardship and recover$q$, $q$Lichens survive freezing mountains and dry deserts and can "recover within minutes once water returns," so resilient means able to survive hardship and recover. Being made of two organisms is explained in paragraph 1, not in the examples that define this word.$q$, 'draft', '731f37bb-eb89-5cb4-98c8-2dc7b0f84d38')
